{"id":"eb320629ddc49775","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-top4-fundamental-groupoid.md","title":"ZFC Top4 Fundamental Groupoid","display":"df-zfc-top4-fundamental-groupoid — ZFC Top4 Fundamental Groupoid","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top4-fundamental-groupoid","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top4-fundamental-groupoid"],"display":"df-zfc-top4-fundamental-groupoid — ZFC Top4 Fundamental Groupoid","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-path]]","[[58-df-continuous-map]]","[[58-df-real-line]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top4-fundamental-groupoid"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top4-fundamental-groupoid</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top4-fundamental-groupoid — ZFC Top4 Fundamental Groupoid"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"600d3de34015fa31\" href=\"?note=600d3de34015fa31\" title=\"58-df-path\">58-df-path</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"88bd8690da417bbc\" href=\"?note=88bd8690da417bbc\" title=\"58-df-real-line\">58-df-real-line</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\Pi,M,s,t,e,m,i,x,y,z,\\gamma,\\delta,H,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau_I,\\tau_{I^2}\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\Pi,M,s,t,e,m,i,x,y,z,\\gamma,\\delta,H,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau_I,\\tau_{I^2}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\)</span> (typed path predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"600d3de34015fa31\" href=\"?note=600d3de34015fa31\" title=\"58-df-path\">58-df-path</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> (typed continuous-map predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a> 的二元有序对乘积拓扑函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"88bd8690da417bbc\" href=\"?note=88bd8690da417bbc\" title=\"58-df-real-line\">58-df-real-line</a> 的通常实拓扑。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelEndpointHomotopic}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{RelEndpointHomotopic}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (endpoint-relative path-homotopy predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\">\\([\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\)</span> (endpoint-relative homotopy class defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_x,\\bar\\gamma,\\delta\\star\\gamma\">\\(c_x,\\bar\\gamma,\\delta\\star\\gamma\\)</span> (constant path, reversed path, and path concatenation defined here as set-coded functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (typed function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4FundamentalGroupoid}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4FundamentalGroupoid}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}unit\\text{-}interval} \\vdash I\\coloneqq[0,1]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}unit\\text{-}interval} \\vdash I\\coloneqq[0,1]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}unit\\text{-}interval\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_I\\coloneqq\\{U\\cap I:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}unit\\text{-}interval\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_I\\coloneqq\\{U\\cap I:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}constant\\text{-}path} \\vdash\nx\\in X\\to c_x\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,x\\rangle:u\\in I\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}constant\\text{-}path} \\vdash\nx\\in X\\to c_x\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,x\\rangle:u\\in I\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}reverse\\text{-}path} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\to\n\\bar\\gamma\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,\\gamma(1-u)\\rangle:u\\in I\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}reverse\\text{-}path} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\to\n\\bar\\gamma\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,\\gamma(1-u)\\rangle:u\\in I\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}concatenated\\text{-}path} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\delta,y,z,X,\\tau)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\delta\\star\\gamma\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle u,\\gamma(2u)\\rangle:u\\in[0,\\tfrac12]\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle u,\\delta(2u-1)\\rangle:u\\in[\\tfrac12,1]\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}concatenated\\text{-}path} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\delta,y,z,X,\\tau)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\delta\\star\\gamma\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle u,\\gamma(2u)\\rangle:u\\in[0,\\tfrac12]\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle u,\\delta(2u-1)\\rangle:u\\in[\\tfrac12,1]\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}endpoint\\text{-}path\\text{-}homotopy} \\vdash \\mathrm{RelEndpointHomotopic}_S(\\gamma,\\delta,x,y,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\delta,x,y,X,\\tau)\\land\\exists H,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau_{I^2}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,2,\\{I\\})\\land\\vec X(0)=I\\land\\vec X(1)=I\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,\\{\\tau_I\\})\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\tau_I\\land\\vec\\tau(1)=\\tau_I\\land\\tau_{I^2}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(I,\\tau_I,I,\\tau_I)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,I\\times I,\\tau_{I^2},X,\\tau)\\land\\forall u\\in I\\;(H(\\langle u,0\\rangle)=\\gamma(u)\\land H(\\langle u,1\\rangle)=\\delta(u))\\land\\forall v\\in I\\;(H(\\langle0,v\\rangle)=x\\land H(\\langle1,v\\rangle)=y)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}endpoint\\text{-}path\\text{-}homotopy} \\vdash \\mathrm{RelEndpointHomotopic}_S(\\gamma,\\delta,x,y,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\delta,x,y,X,\\tau)\\land\\exists H,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau_{I^2}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,2,\\{I\\})\\land\\vec X(0)=I\\land\\vec X(1)=I\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,\\{\\tau_I\\})\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\tau_I\\land\\vec\\tau(1)=\\tau_I\\land\\tau_{I^2}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(I,\\tau_I,I,\\tau_I)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,I\\times I,\\tau_{I^2},X,\\tau)\\land\\forall u\\in I\\;(H(\\langle u,0\\rangle)=\\gamma(u)\\land H(\\langle u,1\\rangle)=\\delta(u))\\land\\forall v\\in I\\;(H(\\langle0,v\\rangle)=x\\land H(\\langle1,v\\rangle)=y)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}endpoint\\text{-}path\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\to[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\coloneqq\\{\\delta\\in X^I:\\mathrm{RelEndpointHomotopic}_S(\\gamma,\\delta,x,y,X,\\tau)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}endpoint\\text{-}path\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\to[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\coloneqq\\{\\delta\\in X^I:\\mathrm{RelEndpointHomotopic}_S(\\gamma,\\delta,x,y,X,\\tau)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}fundamental\\text{-}groupoid} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4FundamentalGroupoid}_S(X,\\tau,\\Pi)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists M,s,t,e,m,i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(M=\\{\\langle x,y,[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\rangle:x,y\\in X\\land\\gamma\\in X^I\\land\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\}\\land\\Pi=\\langle X,M,s,t,e,m,i\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,M,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,M,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,X,M)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,M,M)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(m,\\{\\langle b,a\\rangle\\in M\\times M:s(b)=t(a)\\},M\\right)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\forall\\gamma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\to\\bigl(s(\\langle x,y,[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\rangle)=x\\land t(\\langle x,y,[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\rangle)=y\\land i(\\langle x,y,[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\rangle)=\\langle y,x,[\\bar\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{y,x}\\rangle\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(e(x)=\\langle x,x,[c_x]^{X,\\tau}_{x,x}\\rangle\\bigr)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\\forall\\gamma,\\delta\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\delta,y,z,X,\\tau))\\to m(\\langle\\langle y,z,[\\delta]^{X,\\tau}_{y,z}\\rangle,\\langle x,y,[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\rangle\\rangle)=\\langle x,z,[\\delta\\star\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,z}\\rangle\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}fundamental\\text{-}groupoid} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4FundamentalGroupoid}_S(X,\\tau,\\Pi)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists M,s,t,e,m,i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(M=\\{\\langle x,y,[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\rangle:x,y\\in X\\land\\gamma\\in X^I\\land\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\}\\land\\Pi=\\langle X,M,s,t,e,m,i\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,M,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,M,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,X,M)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,M,M)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(m,\\{\\langle b,a\\rangle\\in M\\times M:s(b)=t(a)\\},M\\right)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\forall\\gamma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\to\\bigl(s(\\langle x,y,[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\rangle)=x\\land t(\\langle x,y,[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\rangle)=y\\land i(\\langle x,y,[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\rangle)=\\langle y,x,[\\bar\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{y,x}\\rangle\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(e(x)=\\langle x,x,[c_x]^{X,\\tau}_{x,x}\\rangle\\bigr)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\\forall\\gamma,\\delta\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\delta,y,z,X,\\tau))\\to m(\\langle\\langle y,z,[\\delta]^{X,\\tau}_{y,z}\\rangle,\\langle x,y,[\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,y}\\rangle\\rangle)=\\langle x,z,[\\delta\\star\\gamma]^{X,\\tau}_{x,z}\\rangle\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Endpoint-relative homotopy and its equivalence classes are now defined in this atom with the actual five-argument path signature and an explicit product topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^2\">\\(I^2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Constant paths, reversals, and concatenations are explicit set-coded functions, so the groupoid operations do not rely on hidden meta-level path constructors.</li>\n<li>Path connectedness is not required: a fundamental groupoid is defined for every topological space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hy